Description: mount a Google Drive account as an on-demand FUSE filesystem
 Cloud Fuse mounts a Google Drive account as an on-demand, read-write FUSE
 filesystem.  This package contains the daemon, the cloud-fuse command-line
 client, and the terminal user interface.
 .
